  126:   /// Tracks whether the pointer sits over the scrollbar gutter so the thumb
  127:   /// does not show the text (I-beam) cursor. The gutter is the trailing-edge
  128:   /// band when the list is scrollable; hovering it toggles [_overScrollbar].
  129:   void _onPointerHover(PointerHoverEvent event) {
