  137:   /// The cursor for the current hover region. Over the scrollbar gutter we
  138:   /// show a click cursor (so the thumb does not inherit the editing cursor);
  139:   /// elsewhere the editable surface shows the text (I-beam) cursor and a
  140:   /// read-only surface keeps the default arrow.
  141:   MouseCursor _resolvedCursor() {
